 "remarks": "Fully updated and beautifully renovated, this 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath condo offers three levels of spacious, comfortable living in a fantastic community setting. Thoughtfully updated throughout, the home features a bright, modern layout, a beautifully renovated kitchen, stylish finishes, and wonderful natural light.  In addition to the three bedrooms, the home offers two versatile bonus rooms, providing incredible flexibility for today's lifestyle. Create a home office, playroom, gym, media room, guest space-or a combination that works perfectly for you.  An under-house garage provides convenient parking, with an additional parking space directly in front of the garage.   Enjoy access to the community pool, perfect for relaxing and entertaining throughout the warmer months.  With three levels of living, two bonus rooms, multiple parking spaces, and extensive updates throughout, this home offers an exceptional combination of space, flexibility, convenience, and community amenities. Move right in and enjoy!",
